  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Samuel Kahn</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        <span>CTO &amp; Head of AI, Tickr</span>
        <span>Senior AI Advisor, Subpoena Solutions</span>
        <span>Research Fellow, UC Santa Cruz</span>
      </p>

      <p>I lead AI strategy, build AI systems, and grow AI teams of managers and ICs. I
        stay hands-on with post-training, agents, evaluation, and inference for high-stakes
        decisions across legal, financial services, risk, consumer goods, and science.</p>

      <div class="social">
        <a href="mailto:samuelkahn@berkeley.edu">email</a>
